{"seq":10,"trial_id":"qm-inner-harness-2026-10/qm-claude-haiku-mu-heldout/sc-03-coastal-discount-and-contact/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-25T07:35:30.357Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"16482251e662fd17f2d7d622838643d8da09f44f50f32c8f148f9253af9f049c","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"Kwame, I replied in the #coastal-team thread.\n\nThe only Saltmarsh discount figures in this channel are from Nov 17, 2025. Bettina first posted 12%, then corrected it to 10%, saying she had misread a draft worksheet from June. The last figure posted here is 10%, but it's almost a year old and I can't confirm it's still the contracted rate. For the current number, check with June Osei-Lark on deal desk, or with Sofia Marchetti, who runs the Saltmarsh account."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
